# Project build config for home:ciriarte:pbs-client
# Apply with:  osc meta prjconf home:ciriarte:pbs-client -F project/_config
#
# Intentionally minimal. The build carries its own offline Rust toolchain (in the
# Source0 bundle), so none of the previous distro-rust steering is needed:
